[{"id":177308571,"discussion_id":"9da8c10cf79216ffcb640181fa467a9440174098","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n Sunee, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-06-26T15:13:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T15:13:35+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177308572,"discussion_id":"98ba8600f9aeaba9ca1ab2e74a0c45a68a62e77e","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| pkg_inc | ✅ [*王永光*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang), [*wangrui_*](https://gitcode.com/wangrui_), [*宋恺*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111) (3/2) | ✅ [*王永光*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang) (1/1) |\n| repo-cann/opbase | ✅ [*宋恺*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111), [*wangrui_*](https://gitcode.com/wangrui_) (2/2) | ✅ [*宋恺*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n Sunee, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-06-26T15:13:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T10:44:33+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177309242,"discussion_id":"6db3218a77915bf9ecad8a0bedd14d30c2b3511c","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `reduceSum` 在非连续（non-contiguous）张量场景下的精度问题。问题根因在于 `CheckIsContiguous` 函数中判断张量是否连续的逻辑存在缺陷：`isContiguous` 标志在循环遍历各维度时被反复覆盖而非累积求与，导致该函数实际上仅检查了最后一个维度的连续性，错误地将非连续张量判定为连续。这会引发后续 Tiling 策略选择偏差，最终导致非连续场景下的数值精度异常。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`CheckIsContiguous` 连续性别断逻辑修复**：将 `isContiguous` 初始值从 `false` 改为 `true`，并在循环中将逐层赋值 `=` 改为累积合取 `&&`（即 `isContiguous = isContiguous && ...`）,确保所有维度的连续性都被检查后才返回结果。\n- **Tiling Key 的 `isContiguous` 标记准确性修复**：由于 `SetTilingKey` 依赖 `CheckIsContiguous` 的返回值来设置 `tilingKey_.isContiguous`，修复后非连续张量的 Tiling Key 将正确反映非连续特性，从而选择正确的 Tiling 策略。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T15:15:51+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T15:15:51+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177310775,"discussion_id":"7705d4c615f7a15483c3cd9c471ae4582bf6cecd","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T15:20:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T15:20:31+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.pn